{
  "contentId": "1248178078",
  "title": "003 冬（残）奥会线上内安标准",
  "body": "<p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8f9dc294-726f-4de9-9991-906007e53593\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\"><font style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:24px\" data-size=\"16\">内部涉密内容禁止外传</font></span></strong></p><table data-bordercolor=\"#cccccc\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7bc3f4e5-c64e-432f-9c1f-038c06883fdb\"><tbody><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-HU8huaTn\"><th data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2d8e27c0-6c65-4ce7-bb18-7b3e30cd687f\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ccb0b434-bd30-4b67-9b4c-9c153ea10795\">风险点</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-84fc59b5-928e-4f84-826f-90eccd5ff4b5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-43943ba8-42a9-4225-ac49-7599f3fad8e6\">适用范围</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a230962f-50c2-4815-804c-91d0a3e8fa21\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bdc31a04-ae32-4d03-9c09-fc4027a9d797\">审核细则</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(246, 246, 246);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1c338b7d-077e-4ee8-bfa1-93ddd03ee84e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-24bf2b37-3814-4fe7-935a-2c7da69324e1\">文字案例</p></th><th data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5ed9337c-4ebc-4fce-901d-d31406a3d446\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ca0ea28b-93d4-41bd-b00a-89e27524fe5a\">图片案例</p></th></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-e0f254d0-4759-42c3-bb43-742d7745f8d1\"><td rowspan=\"3\" data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-14d5ec6e-43ac-4060-8979-1c018498b1dc\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4677e155-6734-453b-8b2b-4b5e43c3ad09\"><strong>涉政负面</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a2d191cf-38c1-44b2-ad6d-1803067acc70\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-637e5234-3a39-42dc-9f3f-02868dc06754\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-53a7e5e4-397d-49ed-8741-61decc55bfae\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d9e18d51-4527-427e-9ac8-f564f2c8e40d\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-79a4d166-6fe5-4ce2-a7e8-58be0a5a8634\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4d4032fd-12af-43fe-8809-6df59ad54eb3\">抵制冬奥/借英美等国抵制冬奥，攻击国家领导人、攻击党政、讽刺中国无人权等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-68e2ba2e-f109-4ffb-8161-b9cc3d2d1a11\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-43e898a1-2b52-4dd3-9d58-3a6e38742d1f\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-f870c690-61c6-42d0-8867-459c1a09a0be\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c913d1eb-4447-4c2c-a938-c080dfe5ca85\">布兰特向《图片报》表示：“德国新政府将在此首次显示，人权对他们是否重要。”他还说：“在奥林匹克这个和平与相互理解的节日上展示自己，而旁边就是允许酷刑和杀害的集权者习近平，这将是个丑闻。普京和其他人适合去那里，但西方民主人士不应前往。”</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-18f20d0c-2484-43e2-9a90-e58ff81b4283\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e7078099-bda3-4a76-b7ed-01901a1ead21\">对2022年北京冬奥会的外交抵制源于国际社会对中国一系列侵犯人权行为的广泛谴责，其中包括大规模拘留新疆维吾尔人相关的指控，打压香港民主活动人士和民主派立法会议员，骚扰及迫害中国人权律师、政治异议人士及报道COVID-19疫情在中国首发时情况的公民记者，等等。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ec593267-fcc7-45fc-ae65-5a2507c09c83\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-453ccb87-76d5-46d5-a207-5194ef95a5ef\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 269px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999911?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438819260?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912893?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"269\" data-height=\"202\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 177px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912896?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912950?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438895963?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"177\" data-height=\"206\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 100px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438873558?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912895?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438873555?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"100\" data-height=\"152\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 213px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999868?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438873556?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438873554?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"213\" data-height=\"140\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 141px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1488430734?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1488430734?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1488430734?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"141\" data-height=\"144\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-be99a361-33d9-4764-af60-3bd090e89c6f\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-49f63d69-8510-4811-82f1-2b0c60fecba1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3575ff47-3d33-443e-83e3-5510da2de299\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-aae30282-25b8-4bcb-8226-821d381e2554\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-18cef5ee-9618-4b98-ace3-78fd6605fd2b\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e77a9149-ebe4-4b01-a3fa-83f12d531f02\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-05632164-6d6e-4ec7-b495-1daecb413848\">借英美等国抵制冬奥，关联领导人负面（如彭帅张高丽），讽刺我国领导人，隐射我国体坛乱象，质疑中国是否有资格开办冬奥会等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d1db95a7-010d-4727-bfa5-ebf10d494365\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-421e1b00-8111-4bc3-85e3-402e8dbf3767\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-aed81881-560d-4f6d-a165-c5b40bd80b1c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7f725423-b90d-4644-87f1-7f748604cbed\">專訪前泳壇名將黃曉敏：中國還有很多彭帥</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-96817bcc-f355-4613-8b51-6ec3baad5b45\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-df42df40-fa9e-4ae4-8979-3a19515d4c9e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">所以，彭帅和张高丽的事，中国打算不惜外国纷纷抵制冬奥，也要瞒下去？？？</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f068cd57-f913-4bdd-941d-397a76b44cf1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8455d2a9-a58c-44a6-bd12-e50eccf74b19\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 196px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912956?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999867?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912803?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"196\" data-height=\"138\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 251px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912958?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438941499?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1437949222?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"251\" data-height=\"136\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-24007d76-1af7-444d-aca2-83a2dce985cc\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-511e955d-def1-424e-91d9-623bfaab8e6e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bae518ff-20b8-4723-b7cd-ad719e684440\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-3b127f69-0ebf-45d1-a7b6-23bc8d32aa1a\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-db40c0d7-3a78-45a8-8b4a-847e1673767b\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ce47b711-71e7-498c-b948-e3926cbe82fb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0b4bd355-9445-40ab-971b-4712bcfa07d2\">涉及将冬奥会和1936年奥运会类比，将我国领导与希特勒进行比对，抨击我国借冬奥美化形象，模糊疫情来源、掩盖“独裁专制”本质等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-02c4a40f-fdaf-402d-aff9-f87b2d0d6d6c\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6070c798-571d-40e1-934b-e84344c5ee40\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e3d125d4-19eb-45f7-b140-389659f91361\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1f88c1c1-7d1e-4ffd-8613-59d298bb761e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">1936年阿道夫·希特勒利用举办奥运会，展示德意志厉害国如何牛逼，美化纳粹形象。之后就发动了大规模侵略战争。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">今天中国的习特勒也想通过2022冬奥改变自身形象，兜售猪头思想。</span><br><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">85年前纳粹故事又在中国上演，大多西方国家如若不作全面抵制，继续采取绥靖政策，后果将不堪设想。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-d24427be-3e40-4fe1-bc4c-206f1024662c\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-11632c25-8995-4f1d-873e-6603c21ced07\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">借举办</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">冬奥会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">将病毒来源模糊化、去共化，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">冬奥会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">后打台湾，将中共房地产经济爆雷引向西方，实现人民币数字化、货币去美国化。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-98fa1d23-e184-4e8a-ac63-8afa7e0a058e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dd11b5e3-4383-4e39-9de7-1dee1d30b4ac\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 224px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999913?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999912?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912949?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"224\" data-height=\"175\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 229px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999869?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438895965?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912894?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"229\" data-height=\"171\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-6566d585-e7ec-477d-8023-0a1629a96005\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c7caddcc-e68e-4781-977f-d7573c1cf534\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bc1e8b0e-3216-4001-b4a3-32a6912a49d8\"><strong>分裂势力</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-0af053b2-ad4f-475e-96d6-c369073ad4b0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9e6e6373-67a2-4212-8d9e-cf8e9987d400\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d3083aaf-5afe-4dbf-ba99-4b77d6beb078\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1f162660-5061-4709-98b0-11dca0bd6dd3\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-fc52bca2-692f-496d-93ae-f3ad3d70e6fa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fd01449e-ca9c-4da3-959a-85a740736c68\">涉及藏独、疆独等分裂旗帜、标识、首饰及映射奥运村出现分裂势力等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6fe802f3-4110-4ae9-b404-b36c546d9cba\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">      备注：奥运村是政治自由空间，可以自由表达言论，对于分裂势力的旗帜、首饰等出现不会进行限制，谨防在拍摄奥运村的图片中出现此内容，防止在平台漏出。</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-bbfa019f-179a-4219-9e29-b0d85822e953\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-95735a2d-9c9b-4e17-b539-2ca856aa43c8\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-938df9dd-3e15-488e-9c8d-44530fb796e3\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-71533eaf-7632-4148-a8c9-c5cecfc73e2d\">数据显示上千西藏政治犯被关押，海外藏人呼吁国际抵制北京冬奥。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-07e7f71b-0b04-46ba-b57a-a1013181cbe5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b2ff349b-a28e-4e40-ad02-36fbc06ac463\">冬奥没“人权”就没“奥运” 疆藏港台独团体呼吁抵制北京冬奥。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-399986a4-6e81-4cb0-95ff-f86d1dd52f68\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b68fbfa8-afaa-4587-84e6-22e87bd1da07\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 193px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999870?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438941501?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999866?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"193\" data-height=\"108\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 234px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438912807?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438895967?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438941498?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"234\" data-height=\"105\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 244px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sa