3db-0926dbeffb29\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4504fe1c-ad1f-4a64-b36f-b7b3b84ca122\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ec0ab37b-8d06-44f3-a1ef-733f33ef3545\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-271428d0-e45d-40c3-82fc-fa1b8b48f028\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">这太敷衍了吧？光停工停产怎么行？我觉得应该按照最新的那个针对疫情防控的最高水平的科研成果来一波“超时空管控”，也就是把</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">冬奥会</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">会场周围800公里范围内清空，做到鸡犬不留了无生气的状态才行。至于居民，呵呵，爱去哪儿去哪儿，反正在禁区内就是死罪！</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-5d586d7c-6262-4d26-9110-28a8d5cd1dcc\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e385b8d3-367e-48c1-88ff-d536e1e22075\">政治藍天！北京冬奧管制華北重工業「躺平」到3月。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a7f8d1e4-7fd4-4b46-9584-025bf15a5d0b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-86703fb2-368f-4de4-bdcf-c34fce5ab18e\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 180px\"><img alt=\"image.jpeg\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438873560?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438895972?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1438999915?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"180\" data-height=\"241\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-884a9543-28d0-4318-85ae-2482c7c554fe\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-db18f026-e1bd-4d71-b9d7-6d6ea0979e75\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5165475e-aafd-4b61-aee5-d25ec105e70b\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-cc8c18ef-2828-4107-8e2f-0c0b7dbe6da5\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c847c751-b49a-4ab5-bc8e-6a5e16a684f7\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ca753d1e-4790-46d5-9a7a-bad97916d372\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-c0775463-6155-4617-a7fb-e2740758c95c\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">涉借冬奥开办，虚构夸大疫情扩散，引起恐慌相关内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需打击。</span></strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-573f1db2-1a8e-40e3-aab9-0c7714b9711d\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-91b523de-78f5-42ef-a30b-55b948436e40\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-20703127-6d9f-425c-9f35-50c34698c91b\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1eb24987-be06-43cf-9b82-6342502a8e5b\">冬奥这么大的人流量，按道理说感染人数起码会上千吧</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-458c1cfa-1c72-4bc3-8bff-7dbe47ac784f\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8020720b-7a84-4b5d-8ccc-773d439dd98b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">还有问题是冬奥会以后共匪就有推脱疫情的借口了，会大力封城</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-c3a3f7eb-656b-48d3-863b-81f6abc15261\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bf7e3108-89c6-45bb-a8bc-32019e7b7a4a\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-1e42cb25-c2d2-42a7-b31b-4ac4da205a7c\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-fd427ea2-6076-49e4-9602-24c84a29f07e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5261006e-7497-4734-a375-2e5f84825ace\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-723756f9-95c0-4475-83c5-346611f85648\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ba91f5fd-423c-4971-beea-48019593de5e\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-58f1af94-f34a-4f67-9caa-3fc48c63382d\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8cc4441d-277e-4487-a5dc-c25a8cb52990\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">涉传播、质疑、暗讽我国运动员使用兴奋剂或无官方消息通报的别国运动员涉兴奋剂相关内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需打击。</span></strong></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e8aad2dd-e3aa-4292-bc60-c0db3270e145\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fbe39f80-cd41-4939-a9a6-bf9430418a45\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">借兴奋剂问题，讽刺我国食品安全，借此攻击党政相关内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需打击。</span></strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-a4011f94-bf1e-40a1-9141-fc097ed83fd9\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-66612168-3525-40a2-88d5-318292288399\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-f56b779a-8d88-47fb-a57f-0d6e596ad2ff\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-aeb9edbe-0c7d-405e-9c29-a710e8cce571\">说什么“冰雪冬奥”啊，不会有人真的相信你国运动员不会用兴奋剂吧？</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-94a7e9f3-ffa6-496c-b6fe-00d7c9c8b05d\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-90db2113-88ad-44ce-9d7d-2fe168a390bb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">“顶级运动员在中国应避免吃肉”</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-83af82d4-1e9d-4659-ad82-e80d7ce026e4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-3c813695-81ff-4c29-92cf-378f4427e9ee\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">在北京冬奥会期间食肉可能隐含“无意中使用兴奋剂”风险！</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f45d730b-94d0-47c0-a24e-fb366eeb7135\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8932469a-572a-4f45-a2fe-f4bff704dee5\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-baac6cc9-8d8c-4de0-8ba2-3eaef0b458bc\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2d49b9a6-bbf2-4c44-bb76-b135b9c537d9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fe603cb5-bf20-487c-9f6f-2e73782821f5\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7fda3d77-c38e-4d60-b108-935e0f8bcb48\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ef3989c9-58dd-4b4e-a597-223f4c300e99\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-8be3d829-514f-405c-8940-2006458c8a4d\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-eb58be2e-22fc-4531-84a3-07836a832e98\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">借本届冬奥归化运动员增多，讽刺国家、党政为获得荣誉不择手段等内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">需打击。</span></strong><br><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">备注：归化运动员指原籍其他国家，后归化中华人民共和国国籍的运动员。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-71932e72-af2b-4637-adb0-8307fa21c085\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4861c378-32cb-4d04-bcdd-ff1abb73ee88\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-32a276e3-4798-4b7f-9246-24bc8d41c634\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8017bd3b-d6eb-44fc-b28d-75d19f5b78c6\">谷爱凌现象，不过是中共与“鸡贼”混血女互相利用的现象： 中共要利用谷爱凌以彰显自己强国之政绩</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5aa17308-b8a7-4900-930d-0d99853d8972\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-56bf67de-4110-48c5-be17-2957ab594c8c\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-c9776c6e-5c86-40ef-9b59-a732ab1013f5\"><td data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-d715a84c-21e0-42a3-987e-39abd211c0f7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b00cc8be-8308-4181-972b-d666d966a51c\"><strong>导向问题</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-57631b66-896a-456b-a877-e31ac47917c9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-95222a7b-4b69-496c-af78-c663fb0686c3\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b3493ae3-0530-432e-80ee-7bbcca4f99a6\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4f2922a7-a032-4781-9d74-53f1677f291b\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-e70745d6-f871-44a3-ab54-255c11e577f6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ddf98a95-8de9-439f-9e53-4565421ecd98\">唱衰冬奥，指责冬奥劳民伤财等内容，需视具体情况进行处理。</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-101233fc-b324-42e2-ba9d-28b05963e22a\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-137b48c6-f439-499c-8d45-b939bfc575c2\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-f3a4e049-bf1f-4596-b3a0-6a64f560053e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2f6926cd-f6bf-4ac8-bb4d-25b91c437760\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">丐帮冬奥会快开始了。</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-c4d37f75-7018-432f-8889-c2a1aef14380\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ee5c6af4-d95d-4281-bf4b-be70bf29774b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">赶紧以实际行动真抵制冬奥会而不是打嘴炮，劳民伤财的运动早就该被抵制了</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-75b702be-1608-43cf-b4c3-c0e581d54505\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-46faf131-d1e2-4cc8-b7b6-2f0d5e9f94d5\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 20, 25)\">我猜这会是历史上最没面子的一次冬奥会，劳民伤财吃力不讨好，还要热脸贴冷屁股。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4154df33-b9b4-47f8-a80b-128bdee7f2a0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7076c83a-767f-4f29-8556-d5ecc438d38d\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-4cfe7b09-edaf-4e15-b2c0-2b388204e037\"><td rowspan=\"3\" data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9fcdc929-344a-48b9-856a-57cd839380c4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-019821fe-49f3-493a-858e-8a8d0d509090\"><strong>冬奥会与残奥会营销</strong></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-11dd1746-64a3-41b9-872b-d55bbdb07fc9\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 232, 231);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-dc6d0403-c129-4d7d-97e9-cb86dfc4eb0d\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1b0847f1-268f-49f2-b24f-70d29a2b8850\">商户</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 232, 231);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e94ba0d6-5358-40d6-812f-6a02bd60cdc6\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a69f4d43-ec62-4715-9939-2e4cbe9d6e16\"><strong>非北京冬奥会合作品牌商户</strong>使用奥林匹克标志、相关元素的内容，<strong>需打击</strong>，包括不限于：</p><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-71f1401f-8ed1-4f73-9034-bb94e6f56b48\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-UKI7h5qa\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4751e9df-7338-425e-b668-b57aaad09023\"><span style=\"color: \">将奥林匹克标志用于</span><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 25, 25)\">纪念币、纪念章、毛绒玩具、体育用品、运动服装、鞋帽、文具等商品或商品包装上</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-96e2946c-65a0-4d6b-8d39-49f9cc854d42\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-b9c16615-016e-4e0b-91ab-f1a65535bab0\"><span style=\"color: \">将奥林匹克标志用于商业服务</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-6d8a4692-2f20-4fef-b874-42b13b0af53f\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5ce71480-2297-4477-9e45-d8c979573f65\"><span style=\"color: \">将奥林匹克标志用于广告宣传、商业展览、营业性演出以及其他商业活动中</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-d8261d46-c11e-4e41-a51e-edd27b1705ff\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dc677e14-50db-4579-be21-0b8292b04c91\"><span style=\"color: \">直接销售奥林匹克标志</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-749d5b82-6a8a-4ad1-8a23-2d220ec0cfac\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-d4cb8fd3-53bb-49a2-b388-a93d7fe86fe1\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用奥运会宣传图片或者运动员比赛场景等奥运元素/素材进行营销宣传</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-7437b7f0-461c-478d-8674-621903c33d5f\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9ed21925-b332-4a1d-b0f9-f01cd70b68ba\">以运动员的形象或名义进行营销宣传</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-b77434c0-a9ad-4be3-8d15-9f9d9733e6f4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f4fa747c-170b-4ea9-8c0d-922025648faf\"><span style=\"color: \">其他以营利为目的利用奥林匹克元素的行为</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 232, 231);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-55bf3164-e88a-4a7e-a743-5775c46aa44f\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dbe67751-b345-4d87-8086-2580dd4e2836\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-J3jtexQ4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0fa5ad85-da1f-48df-8e9b-75db6a9f0b7d\">金牌奥运回锅肉助力奥运</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-ASu2KQ8A\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7d2586aa-85d6-41c9-bb66-671f6f75c803\">奥运期间来全聚德奥运店</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-w2ER2gIt\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-21c1d9d3-2a29-42ae-9a2d-733a78166f75\">张家口老窖冬奥红酒</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-JsyLCxBs\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-84de7934-9941-4177-a605-2aaacd924341\">冬奥特许商品——冬奥会会徽书包（爆款）</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-c96ab6c5-02fe-4111-9ab1-8c22fcccb741\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-69307b7a-0ad8-443e-a8f1-48401dacdbe3\">冬奥期间，来xxx披萨店，竞猜比赛输赢，获最高十倍奖金</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-29390178-2ab9-4498-a10f-e30b2e8a79ef\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-e77d3698-d886-434f-9a33-4b5e4c1215a2\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">冬奥特许文具精品推介：冬奥知识笔记本</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-12208f33-9473-4f8e-83ab-15f5c6839fa1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-8b831ee7-03ac-4ced-8e55-c42ea590b9b6\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">仅售1元，价值50元冬奥特惠季，立减优惠！</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 232, 231);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-698902dd-5d23-4c8d-899b-3c5939835e76\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-efa4bf14-2e16-4448-8a38-7401ef6b1518\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-4161f418-9f06-4c2a-9bf1-2a7a3d016c78\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ad58c391-c495-4a09-b1df-fa42b1680999\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-be9f25e8-8571-41ca-9859-e3e122f4837a\">用户</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-269e4cf6-6a9c-47d1-a42c-056a5463a0a0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-5dd949f8-fe5a-447f-b381-9d944d8cae18\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">ugc（非商户）涉及奥林匹克标识使用，无营销意味，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">可通过</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38)\">。</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-6704deef-7a57-4b6e-9061-0e479b7a3a26\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fc7b8641-b3f3-4f0c-8264-1e6caf14ddb1\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-68c914cf-0028-429e-817d-128d65492a88\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7ffc74ea-1551-4389-900b-7e61dd1c4276\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-f0c42ebd-43f0-45e5-b916-994a9f28237d\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-63763fa3-4d63-4bd5-bf40-9b6eb501dce4\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-30eb26dd-61f8-4dc1-83fe-507ce0735e58\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-37cbb73e-b0f2-4d5b-9428-26ae85b11143\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7ab8ce6c-0641-4a28-a362-028ba4f532e8\"><span style=\"color: \">借招募冬奥志愿者、工作人员进行营销、诈骗等内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: \">需打击。</span></strong></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-bd4881b0-6fda-45c8-81ba-4b1fb1260155\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 77, 79)\">备注：目前冬奥志愿者招募已经结束，需提防诈骗或非正式志愿者招募信息在平台出现。</span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-dd8fecb0-8fbf-4270-baaf-90e3b94d75ef\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-87ea1f72-95cf-4576-8a30-3ee65c4357ff\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7b3ef669-2968-4551-a5c3-086705b242eb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7b3dacbb-0e5e-4f4f-8c06-7cf41571d049\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-94bfaa55-610d-42e5-bd6f-b7b41d643dc2\"><td rowspan=\"2\" data-colwidth=\"178\" width=\"178\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9d132c9d-7a60-4644-a280-8d1dca17a29e\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-a6b5ade5-1fea-4072-82f8-13b39af0fbd6\"><strong>视频侵权</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-def45976-26cc-4ebf-b9e3-0d1b7618ff71\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-01bd8e5d-b621-4e3c-b95a-b74ed7406f26\">商户</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-71506e20-89a2-4795-921a-9b6b6475c1c7\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-150b1bef-9e27-4930-80ff-75971bab7303\">商户、商户直播出现冬奥相关视频（包括但不限于转播、录屏、剪辑等），<strong>需打击。</strong></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9f738230-0c78-4d9f-9335-ca44218163b4\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">备注：若只是带到店内转播、室外大屏转播，不为画面主体，可放过。</span></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-606ff3a2-203e-45e4-86c1-2d99d7f22c87\"></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-1ed59be6-14a0-4ae2-80c6-5f64c549bbe6\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-b9b6471c-081a-4af5-97ea-2d579ad704a8\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-7b8b9d5c-adcc-4d2f-a20d-6645d8ee5306\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-5ffa0292-e2e2-4da0-a3c3-fa27db2cbdcb\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-830da55a-35a8-4de5-b3f2-39a8bc2eedd5\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-9bf78559-c81b-4307-aaa6-1c2a1524701a\"><td data-colwidth=\"274\" width=\"274\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-f5348da9-ee7c-422e-9244-432cc0ddca55\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-25e3c0c8-24ca-4580-b9d6-2b65970e4d0e\">通用</p></td><td data-colwidth=\"559\" width=\"559\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-78fbe8ae-f845-4c6d-be92-5e2d0fa3cd90\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-31d3d9ad-1913-4f90-aefa-082643aa36ff\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-7491d956-4a71-466c-93bd-bee8b0ec9d65\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2aa6abbf-ce03-4d56-83d2-6a8e43826869\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">任何借冬奥视频片段进行营销的UGC内容，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">需打击；</span></strong></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-bcea4ab7-a824-4ac8-bbd5-3967e91d94ce\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-f19a0e24-2524-4ccc-8597-c79ae5e33f48\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">UGC涉及赛事画面转播/录播/视频剪辑，</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">需打击；</span></strong></p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-552a661b-b8c0-416a-a457-98b14e0d134f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">备注：仅打击视频全部为冬奥画面的，视频含其他内容，可放过。（如发布一个自己边吃饭边用电视看冬奥的随手拍，无需过于严格）往届冬奥会视频、混剪、盘点等，可放过。</span></p></li></ul><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dda7a5b8-12f8-4ab2-994b-bce8144aa2a3\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">           </span></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"449\" width=\"449\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-bafafa2a-932c-4ac9-86a0-5f50f33d4106\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2ddeff28-2a54-4af6-b4e2-66894acfc790\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"486\" width=\"486\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2915ffe7-3851-4143-ba0a-64d7d5845508\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cae296a9-71d2-46e7-aba1-fe75c1bef4f1\"><span style=\"color: \"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 224px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1496798636?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1496798636?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1248178078/1496798636?contentType=1\" data-width=\"224\" data-height=\"287\"></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
